// Next normally supplies these through next-env.d.ts, but that file is
// generated by `next dev` / `next build` and is git-ignored, so a fresh
// checkout (CI) has none and `tsc --noEmit` fails on the Leaflet marker
// imports in components/blockPreview/LocationMapPreview.tsx. Referencing the
// types here makes the type check independent of the generated file.
